{"title": "Wooden Desk", "pageid": 38244, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Wooden_Desk", "categories": ["Containers", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Item_FUR_GEN_Desk_Common_B_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/db/Item_FUR_GEN_Desk_Common_B_Faded.png/300px-Item_FUR_GEN_Desk_Common_B_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/d/db/Item_FUR_GEN_Desk_Common_B_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Wooden Desk image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/db/Item_FUR_GEN_Desk_Common_B_Faded.png/300px-Item_FUR_GEN_Desk_Common_B_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/db/Item_FUR_GEN_Desk_Common_B_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Wooden Desk</b> is a static clutter container that cannot be picked up or moved. Usually contains items such as <a href=\"/wiki/Ink_Pot\" title=\"Ink Pot\">Ink Pot</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Quill\" title=\"Quill\">Quill</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Ink_Pot_and_Quill\" title=\"Ink Pot and Quill\">Ink Pot and Quill</a>.\n</p><p><br>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Containers\" title=\"Containers\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/Containers_Icon.png/25px-Containers_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c2/Containers_Icon.png/38px-Containers_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c2/Containers_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Containers\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/Containers_Icon.png/25px-Containers_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c2/Containers_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Containers\" title=\"Containers\">Containers</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Throughout the game as set-dressing and random loot\n</p>\n</div>      \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Passive_features\">Passive features</span></h2>\n<p>Not all Wooden Desks can be destroyed. The ones that can be destroyed have 5 <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\">Hit Points</a>.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width: 62%;\">\n<caption>Resistances</caption>\n<tbody><tr><td><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piercing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">Piercing</span></a></td><td>Resistant</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a></td><td>Vulnerable</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Force\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><